PHa      PASS  36 diagonal phase pairs: monomial, DC, V_max = 0 (Z and the quarter phase included)
   => PH: input non-monomial = False; readout = passive; V_max = 0; induced visible operation: the identity on populations (phases only); class: FAILED-ENVELOPE

-- RW: read-write coupling (ReadWriteFamily shape: a bijection fixing every state outside {a, b})
RWa      PASS  for |S| = 3, 4, 5 the admissible couplings at any knob value are exactly {1, swap(a,b)}
   => RW: input non-monomial = False; readout = passive; V_max = 0; induced visible operation: 1 or the swap at every knob value (monomial; V = 0 by A12/O1-T3); class: FAILED-ENVELOPE

-- ANC: ancilla coupling with readback (exhaustive in o1_envelope M3/M4) and the record instrument
ANCa     PASS  recordInstr's channel is DC; into a blank register it leaves the visible populations unchanged
   => ANC: input non-monomial = False; readout = passive; V_max = 0; induced visible operation: classical (DC) channels; see o1_envelope M3, M4c (2304 runs, V = 0); class: FAILED-ENVELOPE

