TAVa     PASS  the orbit average is DC (a mixture of permutations); sandwich P_coh = 1/2, P_deph = 1/2
   => TAV: input non-monomial = False; readout = passive; V_max = 0; induced visible operation: P(z'|z=0) = (1/2, 1/2) (doubly stochastic); class: FAILED-ENVELOPE

